  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting inclusive green transition in T&#xfc;rkiye</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint programme (JP) will contribute to the inclusion of migrants in the sustainable and green development of T&#xfc;rkiye and its transition to a green and circular economy. The programme was developed based on a blending of the expertise of UNIDO#s Global Cleantech Innovation Programme and IOM#s ongoing engagement with migrant communities and MSME development programme.</narrative>
  </description>
